    "CoiStatement": "This study was supported by a grant from Isagenix International, LLC through an unrestricted research grant to Skidmore College and Paul J. Arciero. #13-086. Paul J. Arciero received honoraria for travel to present preliminary data from Isagenix International, Limited Liability Company (LLC). Paul J. Arciero is president and founder of PRISE LLC, a company marketing health and wellness solutions not related to any Isagenix products used in this study. There are no patents, products in development or marketed products to declare. All authors have no financial interests regarding the outcomes of this investigation. The funder had no roles in the study design, data collection and analysis, and decision to publish.",
